  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Shopware is a Symfony-based open-source commerce platform. Community Edition is MIT-licensed and free, with a Fair Usage policy that expects a paid plan above about €1M GMV. Commercial SaaS/self-serve: Rise from €600/mo (~$660 USD); Evolve from €2400/mo; Beyond is quote-only. Landscape open-source peer — WooCommerce keeps the cluster award. Research grounded 2026-08-18 from shopware.com/en/pricing; EUR amounts converted approximately to USD.",
